  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate-Smart Urban Development and Urban Resilience in Ethiopia Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An Agreement signed between WS Atkins International Limited and UN-Habitat to jointly implement a project, titled &#x201c;Climate-Smart Urban Development and Urban Resilience in Addis Ababa, Ethiopia&#x201d;. UN-Habitat is expected to deliver capacity-building activities in line with the technical proposal submitted to the World Bank (dated 22 April 2021). Atkins is currently delivering 5 Green City Actions Plans for the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development. The Green City Action Plans assess the environmental performance of the cities and prioritizes policy actions and interventions to address key challenges in collaboration with local stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
